  "description": "Installation of a free-standing multi-functional communication hub, comprising digital advertisement displays and telephone",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposed structure, by reason of its scale, location and illumination, would result in an incongruous form of street clutter that would have an intrusive impact, to the detriment of the character and appearance of the application site and surrounding streetscape. The proposal is therefore contrary to D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; HC1 (Heritage conservation and growth) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;of the London Plan (2021); Policies LP1 (Design) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;and LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;and LP7 (Advertisement) of the adopted Hackney Local Plan (2020) and guidance under the NPPF. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
